      "questionName": "price tag, backpack, supermarket, birthday cake",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/SET_3_-_SHOPPING_26a816fb.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Tom: Hey Lisa, did you buy a gift for Sarah?</p>\n<p>Lisa: Yes, I got her a nice <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><input id='fbo-901544-0' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-901544-0' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901544-0' /></span></strong>. She&#8217;ll love it for school!</p>\n<p>Tom: That&#8217;s a great idea. Was it expensive?</p>\n<p>Lisa: Not really. I checked the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><input id='fbo-901544-1' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-901544-1' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901544-1' /></span></strong>, and it was on sale at the shop.</p>\n<p>Tom: Lucky you! I still need to buy the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><input id='fbo-901544-2' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-901544-2' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901544-2' /></span></strong> for the party.</p>\n<p>Lisa: Oh, they have some delicious ones at the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><input id='fbo-901544-3' class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-901544-3' type='text' size='12' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-901544-3' /></span></strong>. You should check there.</p>\n<p>Tom: Good idea. I&#8217;ll go after school. Thanks, Lisa!</p>\n<p>Lisa: No problem. See you at the party!</p>",
