      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopping is much easier now with the rise of <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='0' name='fbo-901602-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-0'></option><option value=\"cheap\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-0-cheap'>cheap</option><option value=\"offline\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-0-offline'>offline</option><option value=\"online\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-0-online'>online</option><option value=\"crowded\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-0-crowded'>crowded</option></select></span></strong> shops, where people can order almost anything from their homes.&nbsp;Good customer <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='1' name='fbo-901602-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-1'></option><option value=\"service\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-1-service'>service</option><option value=\"behavior\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-1-behavior'>behavior</option><option value=\"loyalty\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-1-loyalty'>loyalty</option><option value=\"data\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-1-data'>data</option></select></span></strong>, such as fast delivery and clear return policies, makes online shopping very popular.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">For unique products, a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='2' name='fbo-901602-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-2'></option><option value=\"convenient store\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-2-convenient store'>convenient store</option><option value=\"speciality shop\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-2-speciality shop'>speciality shop</option><option value=\"supermarket\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-2-supermarket'>supermarket</option><option value=\"discount shop\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-2-discount shop'>discount shop</option></select></span></strong> is a perfect place to explore. These shops focus on specific goods, like handmade jewelry or rare books, which attract customers looking for something special. Their <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='3' name='fbo-901602-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-3'></option><option value=\"popularity\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-3-popularity'>popularity</option><option value=\"responsibility\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-3-responsibility'>responsibility</option><option value=\"stress\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-3-stress'>stress</option><option value=\"atmosphere\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-3-atmosphere'>atmosphere</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;has grown because they often sell items of excellent quality and unique designs.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">While shopping can be enjoyable, it&#8217;s important to manage spending wisely. Some people become <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='4' name='fbo-901602-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-4'></option><option value=\"experts\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-4-experts'>experts</option><option value=\"athletes\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-4-athletes'>athletes</option><option value=\"inventors\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-4-inventors'>inventors</option><option value=\"shopaholics\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-4-shopaholics'>shopaholics</option></select></span></strong> who buy too much and therefore have to deal with financial problems. Buyers should prepare a shopping <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>16.6</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-16' index='5' name='fbo-901602-5' data-testid='fillblank-select-901602-5'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-901602-5'></option><option value=\"system\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-5-system'>system</option><option value=\"program\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-5-program'>program</option><option value=\"list\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-5-list'>list</option><option value=\"bill\" data-testid='fillblank-option-901602-5-bill'>bill</option></select></span></strong> before visiting stores or shopping online to avoid overspending. Whether shopping online or in physical stores, being organized and choosing carefully can make the experience more enjoyable and efficient.</p>",
